                                    <div class="vrd-header-label">Capacity</div>
                                    <div class="vrd-prop-list">
                                        <div class="vrd-header-block">
                                            <div class="name">Standing reception</div>
                                            <div class="value">110 guests</div>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="vrd-header-block">
                                            <div class="name">Banquet tables</div>
                                            <div class="value">90 guests</div>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="vrd-header-block">
                                            <div class="name">Seated setup</div>
                                            <div class="value">90 guests</div>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="vrd-header-block">
                                            <div class="name">Mixed layout<br>(banquet tables & theatre seating)</div>
                                            <div class="value">90 guests</div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="vrd-header-sep"></div>
                                <div class="vrd-layout-btn">
                                    <svg class="" viewBox="0 0 25 25" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
    <path d="M18.0781 24.5H0.5V0.5H24.5V24.5H21.6406V23.0938H23.0938V15.4062H16.7422L16.6719 15.4766V20.2344H15.2656V14.0703L15.3359 14H23.0938V1.90625H15.2188V9.96875H19.9531V11.3047L19.8828 11.375H7.57812V9.96875H13.7422L13.8125 9.89844V1.90625H1.90625V9.96875H3.96875V11.375H1.90625V14H3.96875V15.4062H1.90625V23.0938H9.6875V15.4062H7.57812V14H12.2188V15.4062H11.0938V23.0938H18.0781V24.5Z" fill="currentColor" stroke="currentColor"/>
</svg> Layout
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="vrd-header-line">
                                <div class="vrd-header-label">Venue amenities</div>
                                <div class="flex gap-1 flex-wrap">
                                    <div class="vrd-header-block small">Hot and cold catering</div>
                                    <div class="vrd-header-block small">Bar counter</div>
                                    <div class="vrd-header-block small">Built-in sound system</div>
                                    <div class="vrd-header-block small">Installable lighting and video equipment</div>
                                    <div class="vrd-header-block small">Air conditioning</div>
                                    <div class="vrd-header-block small">Wi-Fi</div>
                                    <div class="vrd-header-block small">Ethernet connection</div>
                                    <div class="vrd-header-block small">Direct access to the terrace</div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="vrd-desc">
                            <h3>Location</h3>
                            
                <p><b>The event space operating as the A38 Bistro is located on the ship’s deck level, immediately to the right of the main entrance.</b> The adjoining terrace opens toward the Pest side and can be accessed both from the restaurant and via a separate entrance.</p>
                <p>The restaurant is spacious and bright, with sound-insulated panoramic glass walls running along both longitudinal sides, offering a unique view of the Millennium City Center, the National Theatre, and the Palace of Arts.</p>
                <p>The atmosphere of the interior is defined by the warm tones of natural wood surfaces and carefully placed plants. The green features create a fresh, nature-inspired ambience that harmoniously offsets the industrial character of the venue, while providing a calm and inspiring setting. The restaurant’s panoramic windows can be darkened as required.</p>
            
                        </div>
                    </div>
