                            <div class="vrd-header-line">
                                <div class="vrd-header-label">Venue amenities</div>
                                <div class="flex gap-1 flex-wrap">
                                    <div class="vrd-header-block small">Hot and cold catering</div>
                                    <div class="vrd-header-block small">Bar counter</div>
                                    <div class="vrd-header-block small">Built-in sound system</div>
                                    <div class="vrd-header-block small">Wi-Fi</div>
                                    <div class="vrd-header-block small">Direct access to the restaurant</div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="vrd-desc">
                            <h3>Location</h3>
                            
                <p><b>The Schweppes Terrace, located on the deck level of the newer section of the ship, is one of the A38 Ship’s most distinctive event spaces.</b> It is easily accessible both from the main entrance and through the restaurant.</p>
                <p>Renovated in the spring of 2020, the terrace features a metallic, progressive design language that gives the space a strong character while remaining fully aligned with the ship’s overall identity. The stunning Danube panorama is complemented by Schweppes Hungary’s bold design elements, creating a unique visual experience for guests.</p>
                <p>More than just a cocktail bar, the Schweppes Terrace offers an exclusive atmosphere and a direct connection to the restaurant, making it an ideal venue for social gatherings, private events, business meetings, press events, or even film and photo shoots.</p>
            
                        </div>
                    </div>
