                            <div class="vrd-header-line">
                                <div class="vrd-header-label">Venue amenities</div>
                                <div class="flex gap-1 flex-wrap">
                                    <div class="vrd-header-block small">Hot and cold catering</div>
                                    <div class="vrd-header-block small">Bar counter (except in seated setup)</div>
                                    <div class="vrd-header-block small">Cloakroom</div>
                                    <div class="vrd-header-block small">Built-in sound and lighting system</div>
                                    <div class="vrd-header-block small">Installable camera system and video equipment</div>
                                    <div class="vrd-header-block small">Wi-Fi</div>
                                    <div class="vrd-header-block small">Ethernet connection</div>
                                    <div class="vrd-header-block small">Air conditioning</div>
                                    <div class="vrd-header-block small">Access to the terrace</div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="vrd-desc">
                            <h3>Location</h3>
                            
                <p><b>The concert hall, located in the central section of the ship within the hull, is one of the A38 Ship’s iconic venues and is accessible from the main entrance.</b></p>
                <p>The space is equipped with world-class built-in sound and lighting systems, unique acoustic solutions, comprehensive sound insulation, and a professional broadcast recording system. The single, open-plan interior and its technical setup can be flexibly adapted to meet the specific requirements of each event.</p>
                <p>The concert hall is ideally suited for hosting conferences, award ceremonies, fashion shows, large-scale press events, receptions, and live music performances. A key advantage is its versatility as a plenary hall, while the adjoining spaces – the Motor Bar and the Bow Studio – can function as distinctive breakout or section rooms.</p>
            
                        </div>
