                        </div>

                        <div class="vrd-desc">
                            <h3>Location</h3>
                            
                <p><b>The highest guest area of A38 Ship is located above the restaurant, offering a stunning panoramic view of the city and the Danube.</b> The space is fully covered and weatherproof, with openable side walls that allow it to adapt flexibly to weather conditions and the nature of the event.</p>
                <p>The venue features a bar counter and a separable VIP terrace area. From spring to autumn, it is an ideal location for product launches, larger social gatherings, gala events, and buffet-style receptions.</p>
            
