                        </div>

                        <div class="vrd-desc">
                            <h3>Location</h3>
                            
                <p><b>The Bow Studio (Orr Stúdió) is located in the bow section of the ship, within the hull, and can be accessed both from the main entrance and from the concert hall.</b></p>
                <p>Completely renovated in 2021, this small-scale venue with a distinctive atmosphere is defined by minimalist and industrial interior design elements. Concert posters preserved on one of the walls pay tribute to the A38 Ship’s iconic events.</p>
                <p>The Bow Studio is an ideal choice for smaller concerts, more informal corporate events, and private social gatherings.</p>
            

                        </div>
