                <div class="venue-rentals-description invisible-desc show w-100" data-venue-id="vr_motorbar">
                    <div class="wrapper">
                        <div class="vrd-header">
                            <div class="vrd-header-flex-line">
                                <div>
                                    <div class="vrd-header-label">Area</div>
                                    <div class="venue-area vrd-header-block">
                                        <div class="name">Venue size</div>
                                        <div class="value">70 m<sup>2</sup></div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="vrd-header-sep"></div>
                                <div class="venue-capacity vrd-header-capacity">
                                    <div class="vrd-header-label">Capacity</div>
                                    <div class="vrd-prop-list">
                                        <div class="vrd-header-block">
                                            <div class="name">Standing reception</div>
                                            <div class="value">70 guests</div>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="vrd-header-block">
                                            <div class="name">Banquet tables</div>
                                            <div class="value">32 guests</div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="vrd-header-sep"></div>
                                <div class="vrd-layout-btn"
                                     data-layout-image="https://www.a38.hu/themes/a38_2024/assets/img/rendezveny-galeria/layout.webp"
                                >
                                    <svg class="" viewBox="0 0 25 25" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
    <path d="M18.0781 24.5H0.5V0.5H24.5V24.5H21.6406V23.0938H23.0938V15.4062H16.7422L16.6719 15.4766V20.2344H15.2656V14.0703L15.3359 14H23.0938V1.90625H15.2188V9.96875H19.9531V11.3047L19.8828 11.375H7.57812V9.96875H13.7422L13.8125 9.89844V1.90625H1.90625V9.96875H3.96875V11.375H1.90625V14H3.96875V15.4062H1.90625V23.0938H9.6875V15.4062H7.57812V14H12.2188V15.4062H11.0938V23.0938H18.0781V24.5Z" fill="currentColor" stroke="currentColor"/>
</svg> Layout
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="vrd-header-line">
                                <div class="vrd-header-label">Venue amenities</div>
                                <div class="flex gap-1 flex-wrap">
                                    <div class="vrd-header-block small">Built-in sound system</div>
                                    <div class="vrd-header-block small">Ambient lighting</div>
                                    <div class="vrd-header-block small">Wi-Fi</div>
                                    <div class="vrd-header-block small">Ethernet connection</div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="vrd-desc">
                            <h3>Location</h3>
                            
                <p><b>The Motor Bar is located in the aft section of the ship, inside the hull, behind the concert hall, and can be accessed from there.</b></p>
                <p>Converted from the ship’s former engine room, this distinctive space retains the vessel’s original character. The combination of industrial design elements, the preserved control panel, the diesel engine, custom furnishings, and ambient lighting creates a bold and unique atmosphere.</p>
                <p>The Motor Bar can be connected to the Concert Hall via a corridor, or used as a fully independent space if required. It is an ideal venue for small-scale workshops, press events, presentations, lectures, private gatherings, and birthday celebrations.</p>
            
                        </div>
