        <div class="container mb-8 md:mb-16">
            <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4 md-gap-8">
                <div class="basis-full md:basis-1/2 pl-0 md:pl-[70px]">
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-32 mb-4">Catering</h3>
                    <div class="mb-4">We provide comprehensive catering services for our events, ranging from hot and cold kitchen offerings to welcome bites, finger food menus, and buffet-style selections. Our beverage packages, cocktail bar concepts, welcome drink options, and drink voucher systems can be flexibly tailored to the client’s needs.</div>
                    <div id="additional_catering">
                        <div
	id="catering_selector"
	class="dropdown venue-dropdown small flex-1 mb-4 "
	role="listbox"
	aria-label="Select Option"
	>
	<input type="hidden"
           name="selectedValue"
           value=""
           autocomplete="off"    />
	<div class="dropdown-label">
		<span class="selected-text overflow-hidden">Additinal catering</span>
		<span class="icon-chevron-down"> <svg class="" width="50" height="50" viewbox="0 0 50 50" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
