		class="hidden"
		data-translations="&#x7B;&quot;selected&quot;&#x3A;&quot;Selected&quot;,&quot;selectOptions&quot;&#x3A;&quot;a38.core&#x3A;&#x3A;lang.dropdown.select-options&quot;&#x7D;"
	></div>
</div>                        <div class="hidden catering_foods additinal-desciptions">
                            
            <p><b>Pastries</b>: A carefully curated selection of sweet and savory bites, ideal for welcoming guests.</p>
            <p><b>Sandwich Menus</b>: Open-faced sandwiches prepared on fresh baguette, offering an elegant and practical solution for conferences, press events, or as a midnight selection at private gatherings. Available in vegetarian, vegan, as well as gluten- and lactose-free options.</p>
            <p><b>Cold Platters</b>: Light and classic selections prepared for weddings, birthdays, and festive occasions.</p>
            <p><b>Finger Food</b>: Flexible bite-sized menus for standing receptions. From mini burgers to sushi selections, the offering can be tailored to the style of the event.</p>
            <p><b>Hot Buffet Catering</b>: Buffet-style selections prepared from seasonal ingredients, featuring a variety of starters, main courses, and desserts. Ideal for both corporate and private events.</p>
        
                        </div>
                        <div class="hidden catering_drinks additinal-desciptions">
                            
            <p><b>Welcome drink</b>: A welcome beverage served upon arrival, which may include a cocktail, sparkling wine, non-alcoholic refreshment, or pálinka, according to preference.</p>
            <p><b>Drink vouchers</b>: Redeemable at the bar, drink vouchers provide a practical solution for corporate events, either as a standalone option or combined with beverage packages.</p>
            <p><b>Unlimited beverage packages</b>: Tailor-made drink packages offering unlimited consumption from the selected menu for a pre-agreed duration. Ideal for weddings, birthdays, and corporate events.</p>
        
                        </div>
