                <div class="order-1 md:order-2 basis-full md:basis-1/2">
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-32 mb-4">Technical equipment</h3>
                    <div class="mb-4">The event spaces of A38 Ship are equipped with a high-level technical infrastructure, enabling the professional execution of a wide range of event formats, including conferences, press events, private functions, workshops, and exclusive receptions. Some of the venues feature built-in sound and lighting systems, a stage, DJ booth, and ambient lighting, while others can be flexibly equipped with installable audio, lighting, video, and camera technology.</div>
